OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over 'significant'
OL,4,Aambulance service changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised by
OL,7,Fpoliticians over proposed changes at
OL,8,FSouth East Coast Ambulance Service
OL,9,F(Secamb).
OL,11,FSecamb recently announced it had
OL,12,Fexchanged contracts on a new centre in
OL,13,FFarnborough, where ambulances serving
OL,14,FWest Surrey will be cleaned, restocked
OL,15,Fand prepared for use.
OL,17,FAs part of the plans, the service said
OL,18,Fit would review its existing estate in
OL,19,FFarnborough, Tongham, Guildford,
OL,20,FGodalming and Haslemere to "determine
OL,21,Fwhere response posts would be best
OL,22,Flocated".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
